# Tabular dumps under data trees (keep repo configs as yaml/py)
**/data/**/*.csv
**/data/**/*.json
**/data/**/*.txt

# Broad csv/json for downloaded Alpha158-style dumps at repo root paths
*.csv
*.json

# Allow small benchmark summaries if explicitly needed (uncomment to track):
# !examples/benchmarks/**/*.md

